) a plaque to honor the U.S. Capitol Police and other law enforcement agencies that protected the Capitol, the individuals who died or sustained injuries to protect the Capitol, and the staff who helped restore the Capitol complex after the attack.</p><p>The&nbsp;exhibit shall be installed within two years after the bill's enactment.&nbsp;</p>","updateDate":"2025-02-10T19:44:48Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Capitol Remembrance Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-07-18T00:06:10Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-18T00:06:10Z"}
